# Diagnostic: garrison on the default lobby map (A Hill Between: 54 civilian garrisons).
set render_every 300
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
click start
until 90 scene == game
require scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
view point garrison
click unit 0:E1
click unit 0:E1:1 shift
click unit 0:E1:2 shift
assert selected == 3
click point garrison
wait 3
dump
until 600 in_garrison(0) >= 3
shot g1
dump
end
